          "quote": "The strong effect of oxygen embrittlement due to fast diffusion along grain boundaries (i. e. approx. one micrometer per second in 900 ◦C air) of Ni and related superalloys is also indicated [ 55 ]. The effect of oxygen attack on the present crack tip may thus be of little significance compared to the thermally activated creep processes triggered by twin formation.",
